        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe property has been beautifully maintained and finished to a very high standard, providing bright and comfortable living accommodation ideally suited to family life. The accommodation comprises four bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, generous reception and living areas, kitchen/dining accommodation together with conservatory and well-appointed bathroom facilities.One of the property's most exciting features is the substantial first-floor area, which has already been floored and is ready for redevelopment. This offers an excellent opportunity for the new owner to create additional bedrooms, offices, living space, games room or other accommodation, subject of course to the necessary planning requirements.Externally, the property enjoys a large private site extending to approximately 0.77 Acres, providing considerable space, privacy and scope with electric sliding gates. The elevated setting ensures the property benefits from fantastic views across the surrounding countryside, making this a particularly attractive rural residence.\nBeing located only15 minutes from both Carrick on Shannon and Longford and more importantly 5 Minutes from Dromod where there are 8 trains daily to Dublin and sligo.Whether you are looking for a superb family home, a property with significant future potential, or simply somewhere to enjoy space, privacy and outstanding views, this property is an excellent opportunity and represents exceptional value for money.Key Features• Outstanding elevated four-bedroom bungalow• Approximately 156 sq. m. / 1,679 sq. ft.• Site extending to approximately 0.77 acres• Immaculately presented throughout\n• Under floor heating in the kitchen\n• Solid timber floors• Four bedrooms, including one en-suite• Fantastic panoramic countryside views• Large first-floor area already floored and ready for conversion/redevelopment• Excellent potential to significantly increase accommodation• Generous private grounds• Ideal family home• Viewing highly recommendedA superb home in an exceptional setting with enormous future potential — an opportunity not to be missed."
